    "title": "FIRST ALERT: Fantastic Evening & Quiet Night on the Way! - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Bill Walsh ,\n1 days ago CHARLESTON, S.C. (WCSC) — Our fine looking weather continues as we head into tonight and for the rest of the Easter week. Above-average temperatures will continue into the end of the week with highs in the low to mid 80s inland (upper 60s and low 70s at our beaches); similar daytime temperatures are also in the forecast through Saturday. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
